#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `-Dapp.ports` argument (shown as `8081,8082` in the examples above) is "
"optional -- it lists the ports of your running Quarkus applications. When "
"provided, the AI module connects to them via Dev MCP, enabling source code "
